					"content": "You're back. What's the situation?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jiayi"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080802,
					"content": "So, here's what it's like at Nantianmen...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718080803,
					"content": "Really? There was actually an earthquake? ...Followed by monsters, out of nowhere?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jiayi"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080804,
					"content": "The monsters are no surprise, but these earthquakes... what could be causing them?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jiayi"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080805,
					"content": "Well, whatever the situation — safety is the top priority.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jiayi"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080806,
					"content": "I will report the situation in detail to the Ministry of Civil Affairs. Thank you for your assistance, please take these as a token of my gratitude.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jiayi"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080807,
					"content": "Ugh, the work just keeps piling up, and I can never get on top of it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Jiayi"
				}
			]
