					"content": "Everything seems normal...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080903
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718080903,
					"content": "Normal? So... no earthquakes, no monsters? How strange...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jiayi"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080904,
					"content": "Still, normality is good news. Thank you for your assistance, please take these as a token of my gratitude.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jiayi"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080905,
					"content": "Right, onto the next task... No matter how much I get done, there's always more to do...",
